This ontology fragment represents the `ReservationDelete` operation and its result, as well as the `ReservationDeleteContent` class, which is the content of the `ReservationDeleteResult`. The `ReservationDelete` operation has a required parameter `reservation_name` of type `string`. The `ReservationDeleteResult` and `ReservationDeleteContent` classes are subclasses of `OperationResult` and `OperationContent` respectively, and their schema is a subclass of `v0_0_40_openapi_resp`.
